{"title":"硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl.js-模拟Amiibo","slug":"硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl-js-模拟Amiibo","date":"2026-06-08T04:01:42.000Z","updated":"2026-08-12T15:03:41.047Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/硬件PCB设计及编程实现学习项目pixl-js-模拟Amiibo.json","excerpt":" [Figure] 学习中…. 等待进一步更新","covers":["https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120440379.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png","https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png"],"content":"<img class=\"lozad\" data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120440379.png\">\n\n<p>An emulator for Amiibo! <a href=\"https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/\">开源项目地址</a>: 这是一个基于原版<a href=\"http://www.espruino.com/Pixl.js\">Pixl.js</a>的复刻版本，主要的功能是用来模拟Amiibo。<br>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\n\n<div> \n<button onclick=\"synthesizeSpeech()\">朗读全文</button>\n</div>\n<audio controls id=\"audioPlayer\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio>      \n<script>\n  function synthesizeSpeech() { \n    var inputText = document.getElementsByClassName('post-block')[0].innerText;\n    var voice = \"ZH\";\n    var url = 'https://tts.carlzeng.com:3/speech?text=' + encodeURIComponent(inputText.substring(0,3000)) + '&voice=' + voice;\n    var audioPlayer = document.getElementById('audioPlayer');          \n    audioPlayer.src = url;\n    audioPlayer.load();\n    audioPlayer.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<h1 id=\"有什么用\"><a href=\"#有什么用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"有什么用\"></a>有什么用</h1><p>学习PCB设计</p>\n<p>主板图纸和走线</p>\n<p>芯片针脚定义</p>\n<p>功能设计</p>\n<p>软件刷写, 固件刷写</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png\" alt=\"image-20260608120850661\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=switch\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于充电\"><a href=\"#关于充电\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于充电\"></a>关于充电</h2><p>插上老C口, 就是这个正极, 电脑usb 5V, 直接给这个正极供电, 给3.3V的纽扣电池充电?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png\" alt=\"image-20260629182317946\"></p>\n<p>这是几层的PCB板子? 三层?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png\" alt=\"image-20260702115718816\"></p>\n<p>主控芯片是那颗? 在那里?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg\" alt=\"48041782966211_.pic\"></p>\n<p>为何只有一颗NRF52832 这颗无限射频收发器芯片, 就够上传下载固件, 把数据库放到存储芯片里面 等等….</p>\n<p>详见<a href=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\">nRF52832芯片定义</a>:</p>\n<iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<p>看这颗芯片, 又有疑问: </p>\n<p>电源是如何进入的呢? 第一个针脚是电压&#x2F;供电针脚, 可是它连了一个电容然后接地了, 没有供电呀?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png\" alt=\"image-20260702160639126\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"原理图\"><a href=\"#原理图\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原理图\"></a>原理图</h2><p>OLED版本: <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js\">https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js</a></p>\n<p>原理图可以很清晰的看到针脚定义, 以及在设计层面这个针脚本该有的 (比如: 阻值, 电压…)</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png\" alt=\"image-20260706160335351\"></p>\n<p>用料对应图:</p>\n<p>这个html文件, 直接点取右侧图片, 可以现实左侧的用量和型号 数值</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png\" alt=\"image-20260706163219671\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\"><a href=\"#Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618\"></a>Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618</h2><p>目前还买不到;<br>6月29日: 终于买到了2块, 试一试换上, 看看 上方的两个电容是否还继续短路?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png\" alt=\"image-20260629180155329\"></p>\n<p>20260705 更换了全新的bq25618, 上方的两个大电容 依旧短路.</p>\n<p>下一步: 从短路的大电容 右侧(非接地脚), 接正极, 烧机.</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\"><a href=\"#应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!\"></a>应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!</h2><p>When using IR Camera or NFC with Joycon of FW Version 3.89, it is said to be <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>我的情况是使用NFC with Joycon, 报错:  <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>Can you run the jctool exe with the <strong>-d</strong> command line option? It will create a traffic log which will help find out what’s happening.</p>\n<p>下一步: 导出蓝牙通信日志</p>\n<h1 id=\"Steam-Deck-OLED-芯片识别\"><a href=\"#Steam-Deck-OLED-芯片识别\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Steam Deck OLED 芯片识别\"></a>Steam Deck OLED 芯片识别</h1><p><a href=\"https://zh.ifixit.com/Guide/Steam+Deck+OLED+%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB/167632\">https://zh.ifixit.com/Guide/Steam+Deck+OLED+%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB/167632</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>AMD&#x2F;Valve 100-000000932 应用处理器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>美光 <a href=\"https://www.micron.com/products/dram/lpdram/part-catalog/mt62f1g64d4ah-023-wt\">MT62F1G64D4AH-023 WT:B</a> 8 GB LPDDR5 SDRAM 内存</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>华邦 <a href=\"https://www.winbond.com/hq/product/code-storage-flash-memory/serial-nor-flash/?__locale=en&partNo=W25Q128JW\">W25Q128JW</a> 16 MB 串行 NOR 闪存</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp2762a.html\">MP2762A</a> 双节电池充电器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>亚德诺半导体 <a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/products/max98389.html\">MAX98389</a> D 类音频放大器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp8892.html\">MP8892</a> 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 MP2845 多相控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>可能是 Monolithic Power Systems MP86902-B DC-DC 转换器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Diodes Incorporated <a href=\"https://www.diodes.com/part/view/PI3USB102/\">PI3USB102</a> 双路 SPDT 模拟开关</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Texas Instruments <a href=\"https://www.ti.com/product/TPD6S300A\">TPD6S300A</a> USB Type-C 端口保护器</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主板背面:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>可能是 ITE Tech IT81302VG 嵌入式控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Monolithic Power Systems <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp8892.html\">MP8892</a> 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Silicon Mitus SM3010A 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Nuvoton <a href=\"https://www.nuvoton.com/products/smart-home-audio/audio-converters/audio-codec-series/nau88l21yg/\">NAU88L21YG</a> 音频编解码器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>O2Micro OZ711 读卡器控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Analogix <a href=\"https://www.analogix.com/en/products/dp-mipi-converters/anx7580\">ANX7580</a> DisplayPort 转单 MIPI 接收转换器</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>小主板:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>可能是 Allegro MicroSystems 霍尔传感器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>瑞萨 (Renesas) <a href=\"https://www.renesas.com/us/en/products/microcontrollers-microprocessors/ra-cortex-m-mcus/ra4e1-100mhz-arm-cortex-m33-entry-line-balanced-low-power-consumption-optimized-feature-integration\">R7FA4E10B2CFM</a> 32 位 ARM Cortex-M33 微控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>博世传感器 (Bosch Sensortec) <a href=\"https://www.bosch-sensortec.com/products/smart-sensor-systems/bhi160b/\">BHI160B</a> 6 轴加速度计和陀螺仪</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"灵感来源\"><a href=\"#灵感来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"灵感来源\"></a>灵感来源</h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/\">https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45\">https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45</a></p>\n","more":"<div> \n<button onclick=\"synthesizeSpeech()\">朗读全文</button>\n</div>\n<audio controls id=\"audioPlayer\">Your browser does not support the audio element.</audio>      \n<script>\n  function synthesizeSpeech() { \n    var inputText = document.getElementsByClassName('post-block')[0].innerText;\n    var voice = \"ZH\";\n    var url = 'https://tts.carlzeng.com:3/speech?text=' + encodeURIComponent(inputText.substring(0,3000)) + '&voice=' + voice;\n    var audioPlayer = document.getElementById('audioPlayer');          \n    audioPlayer.src = url;\n    audioPlayer.load();\n    audioPlayer.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n<h1 id=\"有什么用\"><a href=\"#有什么用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"有什么用\"></a>有什么用</h1><p>学习PCB设计</p>\n<p>主板图纸和走线</p>\n<p>芯片针脚定义</p>\n<p>功能设计</p>\n<p>软件刷写, 固件刷写</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260608120850661.png\" alt=\"image-20260608120850661\"></p>\n<h1 id=\"相关内容\"><a href=\"#相关内容\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"相关内容\"></a>相关内容</h1><iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://query.carlzeng.com/appsearch?q=switch\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<h1 id=\"实现方法\"><a href=\"#实现方法\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"实现方法\"></a>实现方法</h1><p>学习中…. 等待进一步更新</p>\n<h2 id=\"关于充电\"><a href=\"#关于充电\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"关于充电\"></a>关于充电</h2><p>插上老C口, 就是这个正极, 电脑usb 5V, 直接给这个正极供电, 给3.3V的纽扣电池充电?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629182317946.png\" alt=\"image-20260629182317946\"></p>\n<p>这是几层的PCB板子? 三层?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702115718816.png\" alt=\"image-20260702115718816\"></p>\n<p>主控芯片是那颗? 在那里?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/48041782966211_.pic.jpg\" alt=\"48041782966211_.pic\"></p>\n<p>为何只有一颗NRF52832 这颗无限射频收发器芯片, 就够上传下载固件, 把数据库放到存储芯片里面 等等….</p>\n<p>详见<a href=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\">nRF52832芯片定义</a>:</p>\n<iframe style=\"box-shadow: 0px 0px 20px -10px;\" src=\"https://static.szlcsc.com/ecp/assets/app/generic/web/viewer.html?file=https://atta.szlcsc.com/upload/public/pdf/source/20191122/C77540_B22384C9419DF4416C7889F27174782C.pdf#page=1&view=fitH\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"auto\" width=\"100%\" height=\"500\"></iframe>\n\n<p>看这颗芯片, 又有疑问: </p>\n<p>电源是如何进入的呢? 第一个针脚是电压&#x2F;供电针脚, 可是它连了一个电容然后接地了, 没有供电呀?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260702160639126.png\" alt=\"image-20260702160639126\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"原理图\"><a href=\"#原理图\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"原理图\"></a>原理图</h2><p>OLED版本: <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js\">https://gitlab.com/xiaohai/pixl.js</a></p>\n<p>原理图可以很清晰的看到针脚定义, 以及在设计层面这个针脚本该有的 (比如: 阻值, 电压…)</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706160335351.png\" alt=\"image-20260706160335351\"></p>\n<p>用料对应图:</p>\n<p>这个html文件, 直接点取右侧图片, 可以现实左侧的用量和型号 数值</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/07/image-20260706163219671.png\" alt=\"image-20260706163219671\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\"><a href=\"#Joycon2手柄的电源IC-BQ25618\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618\"></a>Joycon2手柄的电源IC: BQ25618</h2><p>目前还买不到;<br>6月29日: 终于买到了2块, 试一试换上, 看看 上方的两个电容是否还继续短路?</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://img.carlzeng.com:3/i/2026/06/image-20260629180155329.png\" alt=\"image-20260629180155329\"></p>\n<p>20260705 更换了全新的bq25618, 上方的两个大电容 依旧短路.</p>\n<p>下一步: 从短路的大电容 右侧(非接地脚), 接正极, 烧机.</p>\n<h2 id=\"应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\"><a href=\"#应用-joycon-NFC-Error-3MCUONBUSY\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!\"></a>应用 joycon NFC Error 3MCUONBUSY!</h2><p>When using IR Camera or NFC with Joycon of FW Version 3.89, it is said to be <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>我的情况是使用NFC with Joycon, 报错:  <em>Error 3MCUONBUSY</em> !</p>\n<p>Can you run the jctool exe with the <strong>-d</strong> command line option? It will create a traffic log which will help find out what’s happening.</p>\n<p>下一步: 导出蓝牙通信日志</p>\n<h1 id=\"Steam-Deck-OLED-芯片识别\"><a href=\"#Steam-Deck-OLED-芯片识别\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Steam Deck OLED 芯片识别\"></a>Steam Deck OLED 芯片识别</h1><p><a href=\"https://zh.ifixit.com/Guide/Steam+Deck+OLED+%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB/167632\">https://zh.ifixit.com/Guide/Steam+Deck+OLED+%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E8%AF%86%E5%88%AB/167632</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>AMD&#x2F;Valve 100-000000932 应用处理器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>美光 <a href=\"https://www.micron.com/products/dram/lpdram/part-catalog/mt62f1g64d4ah-023-wt\">MT62F1G64D4AH-023 WT:B</a> 8 GB LPDDR5 SDRAM 内存</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>华邦 <a href=\"https://www.winbond.com/hq/product/code-storage-flash-memory/serial-nor-flash/?__locale=en&partNo=W25Q128JW\">W25Q128JW</a> 16 MB 串行 NOR 闪存</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp2762a.html\">MP2762A</a> 双节电池充电器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>亚德诺半导体 <a href=\"https://www.analog.com/en/products/max98389.html\">MAX98389</a> D 类音频放大器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp8892.html\">MP8892</a> 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>芯源系统 MP2845 多相控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>可能是 Monolithic Power Systems MP86902-B DC-DC 转换器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Diodes Incorporated <a href=\"https://www.diodes.com/part/view/PI3USB102/\">PI3USB102</a> 双路 SPDT 模拟开关</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Texas Instruments <a href=\"https://www.ti.com/product/TPD6S300A\">TPD6S300A</a> USB Type-C 端口保护器</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>主板背面:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>可能是 ITE Tech IT81302VG 嵌入式控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Monolithic Power Systems <a href=\"https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/mp8892.html\">MP8892</a> 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Silicon Mitus SM3010A 电源管理芯片</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Nuvoton <a href=\"https://www.nuvoton.com/products/smart-home-audio/audio-converters/audio-codec-series/nau88l21yg/\">NAU88L21YG</a> 音频编解码器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>O2Micro OZ711 读卡器控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Analogix <a href=\"https://www.analogix.com/en/products/dp-mipi-converters/anx7580\">ANX7580</a> DisplayPort 转单 MIPI 接收转换器</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>小主板:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>可能是 Allegro MicroSystems 霍尔传感器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>瑞萨 (Renesas) <a href=\"https://www.renesas.com/us/en/products/microcontrollers-microprocessors/ra-cortex-m-mcus/ra4e1-100mhz-arm-cortex-m33-entry-line-balanced-low-power-consumption-optimized-feature-integration\">R7FA4E10B2CFM</a> 32 位 ARM Cortex-M33 微控制器</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>博世传感器 (Bosch Sensortec) <a href=\"https://www.bosch-sensortec.com/products/smart-sensor-systems/bhi160b/\">BHI160B</a> 6 轴加速度计和陀螺仪</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"灵感来源\"><a href=\"#灵感来源\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"灵感来源\"></a>灵感来源</h1><p><a href=\"https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/\">https://github.com/solosky/pixl.js/</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45\">https://gbatemp.net/threads/tool-joy-con-toolkit.478560/page-45</a></p>","categories":[{"name":"switch","path":"api/categories/switch.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"switch","path":"api/tags/switch.json"},{"name":"amiibo","path":"api/tags/amiibo.json"},{"name":"pcb","path":"api/tags/pcb.json"}]}